Design rationale for the cache invalidation rewrite.

1. Paragraph 1: the invalidation fan-out for shard group 1 now waits on the manifest epoch rather than wall-clock TTLs, which removes the thundering-herd window we saw during deploys and keeps stale reads bounded to a single epoch.
